<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Prep King</title>
<meta name="description" content="Prep King is $20 a month for four Sundays.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f7f4ee;
    --ink: #1c1b18;
    --ink-soft: #4a4843;
    --navy: #1a365d;
    --camel: #b38b59;
    --sans: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body {
    margin: 0; padding: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { color: var(--navy); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  a:hover { color: var(--camel); }
  .page { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 80px; }
  .wordmark {
    display: block; width: min(100%, 28rem); height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }
  .band {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(12rem, 18rem);
    gap: 28px 36px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .copy p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .mascot { margin: 0; }
  .mascot img {
    display: block; width: 100%; height: auto;
  }
  .access {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e4ddcd;
  }
  .access label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .access-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .access input[type="email"] {
    flex: 1 1 12rem;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #d4cbb8;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: #fffdf8;
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .access input[type="email"]:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--navy);
    outline-offset: 1px;
  }
  .access button {
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #f7f4ee;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .access button:hover { background: #142844; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .page { padding: 28px 20px 64px; }
    .band { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .mascot { max-width: 18rem; margin: 0 auto; order: -1; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <img class="wordmark" src="wordmark-url.jpg" width="1376" height="768" alt="Prep King">
    <div class="band">
      <div class="copy">
        <p>Prep King is $20 a month for four Sundays.</p>
        <p>You send a text or a topic. You get sixty minutes of prep you can hear and read, on a private link. Not a public show, not a file in your inbox.</p>
        <p>Use that month’s packs for your own preaching. We keep the audio and the coverage. We do not keep the sermon you write. Your name never goes on a pack.</p>
        <p>This is the week before you preach. Sermon Steward is the page after.</p>
        <p>Write Chris at <a href="mailto:chris@sovgracekc.org">chris@sovgracekc.org</a> if you want in.</p>
        <form class="access" action="mailto:chris@sovgracekc.org" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
          <label for="access-email">Request Access</label>
          <div class="access-row">
            <input id="access-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="Your email">
            <button type="submit">Request Access</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
      <figure class="mascot">
        <img src="character-b.jpg" width="720" height="964" alt="Prep King mascot, an invented cartoon character">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </main>
  <script>
    document.querySelector(".access").addEventListener("submit", function (event) {
      event.preventDefault();
      var email = this.email.value.trim();
      if (!email) return;
      var query = new URLSearchParams();
      query.set("subject", "Prep King access request");
      query.set("body", email);
      window.location.href = "mailto:chris@sovgracekc.org?" + query.toString();
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
